5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know how this affects our actual time! I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. It's important to understand the financial constraints before we decide.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported. We need to be fair about the seating quality and how it affects new members.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'll check the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check. Physical comfort and noise levels are often ignored, but they are essential for focus.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and the arrival times in the badge records! I want to see how where we sit affects how we talk to each other.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Does anyone else think we should check the badge records? @Yumi, I'm curious if people arrive at the same time or if it's all over the place!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi is already covering that. I believe the current distribution of research is sufficient to cover the financial, physical, and social aspects of the layout. Let's see what we find.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. We have a comprehensive spread of topics. I'm particularly interested to see if the staff survey reveals a consensus on what makes a ""bad"" seat, so we can address it openly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I agree. Logic dictates that we first gather the data before debating the layout. I'm interested to see if the physical reality of the room matches our subjective feelings about it.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm glad we're all on the same page! I'll make sure to pay close attention to those badge records for you, @Rin. I can't wait to see how it all fits together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just so excited to see the results! I hope we find a way to make everything super fast and easy for everyone. I'll be waiting for the reports!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Efficiency is key, but so is sustainability. I hope the data reveals a path that doesn't create recurring costs or hidden burdens on our budget.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I hope we can find a solution that doesn't leave anyone feeling overlooked. It's better to be honest about the trade-offs now than to deal with resentment later.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I hope the data proves that comfort isn't just a luxury. If the environment is poorly optimized, no amount of ""fairness"" or ""budgeting"" will make us actually productive.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I hope we find a way to stay connected! It would be so wonderful if our new seats actually helped us talk more and support each other better. I'm rooting for a happy layout!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready! Let's get the information and figure this out together. I can't wait to see what everyone finds!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
