26,1,4,talk,Shion,,I am ready. Let's see if the facts support a layout that prioritizes actual usability over mere convenience.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
